<!--
  English (default). Every string here must exist in values-hi, values-ta and
  values-bn with the same format arguments; TranslationCompletenessTest fails the
  build otherwise.

  Counts are phrased as "Label: 3" rather than "3 test(s)" on purpose. Plural
  rules differ between these languages, and a neutral form reads correctly in
  all of them.
-->
